{"4021740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vivisection", "steam_appid": 4021740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape a nightmare that changes every single day. Trapped in an underground complex, you must leave your secure base, complete daily tasks and search for the items needed to unlock the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a procedurally generated maze of tunnels and rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021740/extras/92cc3b44caa6d4e3d032f674533c0daf.poster.avif?t=1775311001\" width=480 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021740/extras/92cc3b44caa6d4e3d032f674533c0daf.webm?t=1775311001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021740/extras/92cc3b44caa6d4e3d032f674533c0daf.mp4?t=1775311001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge: Find food, flashlights, and tools to help you progress further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021740/extras/22b70c86dc63c4f82dc8ac657e5cf24f.poster.avif?t=1775311001\" width=480 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021740/extras/22b70c86dc63c4f82dc8ac657e5cf24f.webm?t=1775311001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021740/extras/22b70c86dc63c4f82dc8ac657e5cf24f.mp4?t=1775311001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return: Make it back t